y Rewards!\n\nBear is a vicious, all devouring entity that overran the world faster than anyone could've anticipated. Bear only needs to get lucky once, while you must get lucky every single time.\n\nCONTROLS\nSprinting - (Keyboard - Shift) (Controller - B)\nFlashlight - (Keyboard - F) (Controller - X)\nCrouching - (Keyboard - C) (Controller - Left Thumbstick Tap)\n\nBEAR* 2020-2023\nPiloted by Cheedaman and Croutonium.","path":"/game/4785497374-bear","slug":"4785497374-bear","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9ab3b4bd039bac903fea0344ad9c46966d827a540c81533b67824a5ba49eb901.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-57618e95aa06b8d33bc59fe60e982d58/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":16,"visitor":62558431,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T06:58:12.775Z","creator":{"name":"Cheedaman","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6281183,"name":"The Longest Hole In Roblox","desc":"☁ Can you fly to the top of the longest hole in ROBLOX?\n\n✎ Want a boost? Have a look at the shop\n\nDon't forget to thumbs up and favourite! Thank you!\n\nClick the bell for notifications on updates/events! 🔔","path":"/game/6281183-the-longest-hole-in-roblox","slug":"6281183-the-longest-hole-in-roblox","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2c3b97059ca3d79b11e31ea408734036dcaa19a6eda23a612acf477a3ce9b1da.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e6dc8071fea8a5af8ab56a196f811164/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":16,"visitor":103338817,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-08-21T23:31:07.195Z","creator":{"name":"mdude64","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9551640993,"name":"[💎NEW💎] Mining Simulator 2","desc":"The Cleanup Update for Mining Simulator 2 is here!\n\n⚙️ Removed Christmas Event + Decorations!\n🥚 Added Magma Mystery Egg!\n🍀 Added Season 20 Mining Pass!\n\nWelcome to Mining Simulator 2! ⛏️ 💎\n\nExplore the depths of the mines to discover rare materials and ores to sell! Upgrade your backpack and tools to gather more resources.\n\nA game by Rumble Studios.","path":"/game/9551640993-mining-simulator-2","slug":"9551640993-mining-simulator-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c14ee68eb252bb99161622dd6797c2295e0dd289d2bb712afd00ef6ecea28e66.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0dce70889d6d22db732c94aa9a93b7e9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":16,"visitor":210823510,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-08-26T18:52:15.347Z","creator":{"name":"Rumble Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":20,"freeCount":20,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":5}},{"id":534701013,"name":"The Labyrinth","desc":"There are mazes of all shapes and sizes.\r\nMazes can be built with corn, mirrors, or fences.\r\nThey'll lead you to a dead end with winding paths and twists. \r\n\r\nOf course, if you're lucky, it's possible to find an exit.\r\n\r\nBut one thing all mazes have in common is a sense of excitement, indecision, and a desperate desire to escape.\r\n\r\nWill you be able to overcome the next maze? Are you brave enough to face the traps, monsters, and players in the dark realm along the way?\r\n\r\nYou can play solo or form a team with other players and use the resources you find to craft tools and weapons that will aid you on your journey through the labyrinth.\r\n\r\nThis game is based on The Maze Runner with a MMORPG touch to it.","path":"/game/534701013-the-labyrinth","slug":"534701013-the-labyrinth","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6709b1322b89d89749c5a7d139fef819289c8e0b4d82ef5feccf7121fa4ea837.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e62933fad6fb7a7a41c03a83cdd6636a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":16,"visitor":55357118,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-08-26T07:09:16.077Z","creator":{"name":"Nitenity Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":11346342371,"name":"making memes in your basement at 3 AM tycoon","desc":"","path":"/game/1134634